      "hypothesis": "Arithmetic SIMD division-by-three can decode 32 radix-5 bytes into five contiguous digit planes without indirect table loads; paired with a 160-byte plane-major A8 image, it will preserve exact 1.75-bit weights and retain at least 70% of aligned-two-bit four-core throughput.",
